    <string name="perm_required_hint">Both permissions are required. Grant them on this screen — no computer needed.</string>
    <string name="perm_unbound_hint">The permission is already ticked; the system just has not bound the service yet. It usually recovers within seconds, and lyrics keep working meanwhile. If it never does, tap System settings and toggle the switch off and on.</string>
    <string name="perm_unbound_failed_hint">Automatic reconnect did not take effect on this device. Tap System settings, open AnyLyric\'s notification access page and toggle it off and on — this is a system-level stall, not a missing permission.</string>
